equire parental permission before staff use a different name or pronouns.\"\n- **A record can't seat a chair here.** The federal level holds no lever on this topic, so only his own words can, and none are in the sources.\n- **I coded the vote `multi-subject`.** Sec. 3 also bars using the education funds to teach \"gender ideology\". That changes nothing, since the row is blank either way.\n- **`needs_source`:** his own words (a statement, release, floor speech or issue page) on schools telling parents or getting their permission, including anything he said about H.R. 2616.","ttft_ms":8709,"type":"result","duration_ms":22912,"uuid":"91de546c-0153-4d50-ac99-dce9c5dda280","ttft_stream_ms":1336,"time_to_request_ms":79,"first_content_frame_ms":1336,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
